{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_MODEMANAGEMENTGUIDE_SECTION_3_3_1_3_Shutdown_and_Sleep","src":"manifest","doc":"ModeManagementGuide","page":34,"text":"3.3.1.3 Shutdown and Sleep\nThe BswM rules below illustrate only the switch to SLEEP Mode.\nrule SwitchToShutdownMode initially false {\nif (EcuM_CurrentState==POST_RUN && RUNRequested == RELEASED &&\nPOSTRUNRequested == RELEASED) {\nactionlist SwitchToShutdownMode\n}\nactions SwitchToShutdownMode on condition {\ncustom \"EcuM_SetState(ECUM_STATE_SLEEP)\"\n}\nNote that further BswM rules are needed for a complete running system.","caption":"3.3.1.3 Shutdown and Sleep","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_MODEMANAGEMENTGUIDE_SECTION_3_3_1_3_Shutdown_and_Sleep","releases":["R19-11"],"page":35,"hash":"ecedaf69385265e9","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_MODEMANAGEMENTGUIDE_SECTION_3_3_1_3_Shutdown_and_Sleep","releases":["R20-11"],"page":36,"hash":"18fa525f7c8a67ff","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_MODEMANAGEMENTGUIDE_SECTION_3_3_1_3_Shutdown_and_Sleep","releases":["R21-11"],"page":35,"hash":"7cc3870e327ce9f9","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_MODEMANAGEMENTGUIDE_SECTION_3_3_1_3_Shutdown_and_Sleep","releases":["R22-11"],"page":34,"hash":"c8f5ae6519bbc175","caption":""}],"releases":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11"],"kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE (deterministic citation)","rel":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11"],"id":"SWS_EcuM_04122"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.75,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"Release of RUN status evaluation in rule.","rel":[],"id":"SWS_EcuM_04117"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.75,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"Release of POSTRUN status evaluation in rule.","rel":[],"id":"SWS_EcuM_04119"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.75,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"ECUM_STATE_SLEEP state definition.","rel":[],"id":"SWS_EcuM_91005"}],"ok":true,"schema":"versions-explorer@1"